list.description:
一、 岗位职责：
1.根据设计规范设计射频和毫米波集成电路模块如LNA.MIXER,PLLVCO,DA,PA,ABB,ADC,DAC等;
2.指导版图工程师进行版图设计；
3.根据设计结果完成设计文档和测试方案;
4.辅助测试工程师进行芯片问题的debug工作;

list.requirement:
二、 任职要求：
1.具备良好的模拟集成电路和射频集成电路的基础知识;
2.具备良好的电路分析能力，如运放，LNA,MIXER,DA,PA,PLLVCO，ADC,DAC等
3.熟练使用cadence设计工具套件，熟悉后仿真验证流程，熟练使用EM仿真工具;
4.熟练使用主要的射频和微波测试仪器;
5.通过CET-4，英文读写流利;
6.具有良好的沟通能力和团队合作能力.

- Bachelor's degree in business, supply chain management or a related field. Advanced degree or professional certifications (e.g., CIPS, CPIM) are a plus;
- Strong command of Hindi and English languages (Upper-Intermediate or above), Chinese is a plus;
- Proven experience (7+ years) as an indirect procurement manager for the Brand Marketing procurement categories of goods and services (in consumer electronics / fashion / FMCG industries), especially familiar with PAN-India markets;
- In-depth knowledge of procurement principles, strategic sourcing methodologies, and contract negotiation strategies;
- Strong analytical skills with ability to collect, analyze, and interpret complex data;
- Excellent negotiation, communication, and interpersonal skills to build and maintain effective relationships with internal stakeholders and external Vendors;
- Ability to builds high performing teams and develops/grows people managers.
